      "japanese": "忙しいときは時間がたつのが早い。",
      "body_text": "忙しいときは時間がたつのが早い。 \n\n\t\tTime passes quickly when you're busy.",
      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJ忙しいときは時間がたつのが早い。\">\n\t\t\t\t忙しいときは<strong>時間がたつ</strong>のが早い。<strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tTime passes quickly when you're busy. \n\t\t<strong> </strong>",
      "credits_raw": "8184Yoshitomi",
      "verification_class": [
        "bottom"
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 7548,
