      "japanese": "楽しいとき、時間がたつのは早い。",
      "body_text": "楽しいとき、時間がたつのは早い。 \n\n\t\tTime flies when you are having fun.",
      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJ楽しいとき、時間がたつのは早い。\">\n\t\t\t\t楽しいとき、<strong>時間がたつ</strong>のは早い。<strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tTime flies when you are having fun. \n\t\t<strong> </strong>",
      "credits_raw": "8097Terashima",
      "verification_class": [
        "bottom"
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 7582,
