      "japanese": "コンデンサは時間がたつと電荷を失う。",
      "body_text": "コンデンサは時間がたつと電荷を失う。 \n\n\t\tCapacitors lose their charge over time.",
      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJコンデンサは時間がたつと電荷を失う。\">\n\t\t\t\tコンデンサは<strong>時間がたつ</strong>と電荷を失う。<strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tCapacitors lose their charge over time. \n\t\t<strong> </strong>",
